          "lineage": "Yoospira",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "Shell minute, slender, high-spired turriculate anomphalous. Protoconch of ll 1 z smooth whorls with deviated spire, the transition from protoconch to teleoconch indistinct orthocline. Teleoconch of about 8 convex whorls with early whorls smooth and later whorls ornamented with 6 evenly spaced spiral cords; whorl profile more or less symmetrically rounded; suture deep, well impressed. Aperture oval, columellar lip slightly arcuate; base rounded.",
